WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.599
Typing a return into tax software means answering question after question,

00:00:07.599 --> 00:00:11.700
in an order you don't choose, and wondering where each figure was.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.745
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.733
Open the Entry sheet tab.

00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:19.626
At the top: how many values are ready to type,

00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:22.457
how many are estimates that can still change,

00:00:22.457 --> 00:00:26.735
and how many are missing because nothing has been read for them yet.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.287
Each section is a form.

00:00:31.287 --> 00:00:35.100
Every value comes from a document that was read box by box,

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.655
and sits beside the document and page it was read from,

00:00:38.655 --> 00:00:42.275
so you can check it against the page before you type it.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.538
To see only what needs you, choose estimates and missing.

00:00:49.538 --> 00:00:53.387
A section's link takes you to the to-do items that mention it,

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:55.125
so each gap has a next step.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:03.501
Below the sections are the forms still to come, and the questions still open.

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:08.185
Names, Social Security numbers and bank numbers are left for you to type.
